Mythic Upgrades for Sunrise 26.3 (version 0.3.0)

A port of Mythic Upgrades 5.1.1 (Fabric, Minecraft 1.20.1) by TriQue (fabric.mod.json "authors", gradle.properties
mod_author).
Original source: https://github.com/TriQue06/mythic-upgrades-multiloader (branch 1.20.1, version=5.1.1)
Original licence: MIT ("license": "MIT" in fabric.mod.json, license=MIT in gradle.properties). The 1.20.1 branch
ships no licence file; LICENSE is the MIT text from the author's earlier repository,
https://github.com/TriQue06/mythic-upgrades-1.20.x (its copyright line names no holder; the author is TriQue).

Carried to Minecraft 26.3 by lavoide: the rules (budding crystal growth, ore experience, the armour set effects, the
tool effects, the end city loot) are re-implemented in Rust on a mod API, and the content (blocks, items, textures,
models, sounds, loot, recipes, tags, trims, worldgen) is carried over from the original jar and converted to 26.3's
formats. Moved to Sunrise's mod API by arismoko, pinned to the Dev 1 build
bdad86d2d398ff9293002d2dc08702822aea7265. This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (MIT); the
licence text is in LICENSE.
